Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:29.73,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“11M downloads, ~500K
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:29.73,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}monthly active users”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm John Simone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lead engineering at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cline. Cline's been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,around a little over two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,years. We've been open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,source from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:10.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's an open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,coding agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,We work in VS Code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,JetBrains
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,we have a CLI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,we have a desktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recently we have a cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,And, let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,user volume
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,we have about 11 million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:25.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,downloads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,do about half a million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,active users monthly.
